="181" cy="144" r="4" fill="#bbb" stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="76" cy="203" r="4" fill="#bbb" stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="137" cy="84" r="4" fill="#bbb" stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="94" cy="202" r="4" fill="#bbb" stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.5"/></g></svg><div class="mean">Vaidyanātha at Paralī, Bhīmaśaṅkara in Ḍākinī, Rāmeśa at the Setubandha (the bridge to Laṅkā), and Nāgeśa in the Dāruka forest.</div></div>
